  "sourceNotes": [
    "Initial Developer formatting-only failure identified CRLF line endings in the two new shipping files; corrected Core formatting and all final fourteen stages pass.",
    "pre-review-hardening retains original observations/review before test-quality corrections.",
    "post-review-input-alignment retains a passing intermediate correction run with inventory captured before removal of the last formatter-expanded redundant field. The final stable-source Developer run supersedes it; all 471 critical pins match exactly.",
    "Ten additive case-inventory groups bind 41 new executions (30 unit, 11 integration). All 41 Planned release rows exactly unchanged.",
    "Critical pins describe the exact executed working-tree bytes. Canonical files follow Git text/eol normalization; retained evidence uses -text and keeps its original bytes. Final staged-source audit records any newline-only normalization separately."
  ],
